Sorry, tameness and apport are not the same thing.  This is briefly
mentioned in the spoiler you quote, but see
http://www.statslab.cam.ac.uk/~eva/nethack/pets2.html for more
details.  Only treats (for a carnivore, that's tripe, meatballs, and
huge chunks of meat) will help train a pet.

